staff.name = Staff of the Crypt Keeper
staff.description = A stolen hand that still remembers its master's command. Hold Primary for 0.65 seconds, then release five homing souls for 5 stamina. A short tap cancels without cost. Hits charge the signature. Secondary / Signature: spend a full signature bar to call the Keeper's giant skeletal arm down where you aim. Its grasp spares you and your allies.
